WEBVTT

00:10:56.110 --> 00:11:00.072
and you reflect the best parts
of what it means to be fully human.

00:11:01.824 --> 00:11:02.991
And to you guys,

00:11:03.033 --> 00:11:06.453
who are probably feeling more
than a little bit uncomfortable right now.

00:11:06.453 --> 00:11:08.914
(Laughter)

00:11:08.956 --> 00:11:10.999
I do understand.

00:11:11.917 --> 00:11:14.044
I never thought I had privilege.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.130
But I did.

00:11:19.341 --> 00:11:20.718
And so do you.

00:11:21.719 --> 00:11:23.011
What can you do?

00:11:23.637 --> 00:11:29.101
You can believe us when we tell you
that we might, we might have equality,

00:11:29.143 --> 00:11:31.645
but we do not have equity.